=== 9: PROMPT_COMMAND preserves the last argument in $_
status: 0
bash-n: 0
--- stdout
|UNDERSCORE[USER-ARG]
--- stderr
|bash: cannot set terminal process group (-1): Inappropriate ioctl for device
|bash: no job control in this shell
|test$ PROMPT_COMMAND='true PC-ARG'
|test$ true USER-ARG
|test$ echo "UNDERSCORE[$_]"
|test$ unset PROMPT_COMMAND
|test$ exit

