=== 11: PROMPT_COMMAND array elements each see the last command's status
status: 0
bash-n: 0
--- stdout
|PC-SAW[0]
|PC-SAW[6]
|AFTER[6]
|PC-SAW[0]
--- stderr
|bash: cannot set terminal process group (-1): Inappropriate ioctl for device
|bash: no job control in this shell
|test$ PROMPT_COMMAND=('false' 'echo PC-SAW[$?]')
|test$ (exit 6)
|test$ echo "AFTER[$?]"
|test$ unset PROMPT_COMMAND
|test$ exit

