=== 16: prompt expansion preserves $? and PIPESTATUS
status: 0
bash-n: 0
--- stdout
|AFTER[5][4 5]
--- stderr
|bash: cannot set terminal process group (-1): Inappropriate ioctl for device
|bash: no job control in this shell
|test$ PS1='$( (exit 9) | (exit 8) )$ '
|$ (exit 4) | (exit 5)
|$ echo "AFTER[$?][${PIPESTATUS[*]}]"
|$ exit

